<title>UK: Portugal tenders for up to three fuel oil cargoes.</title>
<headline>Portugal tenders for up to three fuel oil cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's state electricity company Electricidade de Portugal (EdP) has tendered to buy up to three 25,000 tonne cargoes of high sulphur fuel, traders said on Monday.</p>
<p>Sources said the tender was for two cargoes with an option for one all to be delivered into Setubal. The delivery dates are May 8-10, May 15-19 and May 23-26 for the option cargo.</p>
<p>The tender closes on Wednesday and is awarded on Thursday.</p>
<p>((-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980))</p>
</text>
